\f0\fs24 \cf0 # The Cetacean Interface\
\
A speculative communication system exploring how humans might communicate with cetaceans in a future where the oceans are restricted.\
\
## About the Project\
\
The Cetacean Interface is an experimental prototype that combines acoustic analysis, visual context, and AI-generated interpretations to explore possible communication between humans and cetaceans.\
\
This is a speculative design project. The interpretations are not verified translations of cetacean communication.\
\
## Built With\
